{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "EZK",
  "chapter": 40,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In the five and twentieth year of our captivity, in the beginning of the year, in the tenth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "day",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of the month, in the fourteenth year after the city was smitten, in the same day the hand of the LORD was upon me, and brought me thither.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In the visions of God he brought me into the land of Israel, and set me upon a very high mountain, by which ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " as the frame of a city on the south.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he brought me thither, and behold, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a man, whose appearance ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " like the appearance of brass, with a line of flax in his hand, and a measuring reed; and he stood in the gate.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the man said to me, Son of man, behold with thy eyes, and hear with thy ears, and set thy heart upon all that I shall show thee; for, to the intent that I might show ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to thee ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "art",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thou brought hither: declare all that thou seest to the house of Israel.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And behold a wall on the outside of the house around, and in the man's hand a measuring reed of six cubits ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "long",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " by the cubit and a hand-breadth: so he measured the breadth of the building, one reed: and the hight, one reed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then he came to the gate which looketh towards the east, and ascended its stairs, and measured the threshhold of the gate, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "which was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " one reed broad; and the other threshhold ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of the gate",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "which was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " one reed broad.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "every",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " little chamber ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " one reed long, and one reed broad; and between the little chambers ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " five cubits; and the threshhold of the gate by the porch of the gate within ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " one reed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He measured also the porch of the gate within, one reed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then he measured the porch of the gate, eight cubits; and its posts, two cubits; and the porch of the gate ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " inward.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the little chambers of the gate eastward ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " three on this side, and three on that side; they three ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of one measure: and the posts had one measure on this side and on that side.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he measured the breadth of the entry of the gate, ten cubits; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the length of the gate, thirteen cubits.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The space also before the little chambers ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " one cubit ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "on this side",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", and the space ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " one cubit on that side: and the little chambers ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " six cubits on this side, and six cubits on that side.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He measured then the gate from the roof of ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "one",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " little chamber to the roof of another: the breadth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " five and twenty cubits, door against door.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He made also posts of sixty cubits; even to the post of the court around the gate.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And from the face of the gate of the entrance to the face of the porch of the inner gate ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " fifty cubits.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " narrow windows to the little chambers, and to their posts within the gate around, and likewise to the arches: and windows ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " around inward: and upon ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "each",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " post ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " palm-trees.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then he brought me into the outward court, and lo, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " chambers, and a pavement made for the court around: thirty chambers ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " upon the pavement.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the pavement by the side of the gates over against the length of the gates ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the lower pavement.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then he measured the breadth from the front of the lower gate to the front of the inner court without, a hundred cubits eastward and northward.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the gate of the outward court that looked towards the north, he measured its length, and its breadth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the little chambers of it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " three on this side and three on that side; and its posts and its arches were after the measure of the first gate; its length ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " fifty cubits, and its breadth five and twenty cubits.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And their windows, and their arches, and their palm-trees, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " after the measure of the gate that looketh towards the east; and they went up to it by seven steps; and its arches ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " before them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the gate of the inner court ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " over against the gate towards the north, and towards the east; and he measured from gate to gate a hundred cubits.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "After that he brought me towards the south, and behold a gate towards the south: and he measured its posts and its arches according to these measures.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " windows in it and in its arches around, like those windows: the length ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " fifty cubits, and the breadth five and twenty cubits.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " seven steps to go up to it, and its arches ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " before them: and it had palm-trees, one on this side, and another on that side, upon its posts.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a gate in the inner court towards the south: and he measured from gate to gate towards the south a hundred cubits.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he brought me to the inner court by the south gate; and he measured the south gate according to these measures;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And its little chambers, and its posts, and its arches, according to these measures; and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " windows in it and in its arches around: ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " fifty cubits long, and five and twenty cubits broad.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the arches around ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " five and twenty cubits long, and five cubits broad.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And its arches ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " towards the outer court; and palm-trees ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " upon its posts: and the ascent to it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "had",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " eight steps.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he brought me into the inner court towards the east: and he measured the gate according to these measures.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And its little chambers, and its posts, and its arches, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " according to these measures; and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " windows in it and in its arches around: ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " fifty cubits long, and five and twenty cubits broad.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.34",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.34",
      "verse": 34,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And its arches ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " towards the outward court; and palm-trees were upon its posts, on this side, and on that side: and the ascent to it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "had",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " eight steps.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.35",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.35",
      "verse": 35,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he brought me to the north gate, and measured ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " according to these measures;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.36",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.36",
      "verse": 36,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Its little chambers, its posts, and its arches, and the windows to it around: the length ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " fifty cubits, and the breadth five and twenty cubits.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.37",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.37",
      "verse": 37,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And its posts ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " towards the outer court; and palm-trees ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " upon its posts, on this side, and on that side: and the ascent to it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "had",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " eight steps.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.40.38",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.40.38",
      "verse": 38,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the chambers and its entries ",
          "kind": "text"
